       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INTRINSIC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NUM1 PIC 9(3) VALUE 25.
       01 WS-NUM2 PIC 9(3) VALUE 36.
       01 WS-RESULT PIC 9(3).
       01 WS-STRING PIC X(20) VALUE 'mainframe'.
       01 WS-UPPER PIC X(20).
       01 WS-LENGTH PIC 99.
       01 WS-REVERSE PIC X(20).
       01 WS-TRIMMED PIC X(20).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           COMPUTE WS-RESULT = FUNCTION MAX(WS-NUM1 WS-NUM2).
           DISPLAY WS-RESULT.

           COMPUTE WS-RESULT = FUNCTION MIN(WS-NUM1 WS-NUM2).
           DISPLAY WS-RESULT.

           COMPUTE WS-RESULT = FUNCTION NUMVAL('123.45').
           DISPLAY WS-RESULT.

           MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(WS-STRING) TO WS-UPPER.
           DISPLAY WS-UPPER.

           MOVE FUNCTION LOWER-CASE(WS-UPPER) TO WS-STRING.
           DISPLAY WS-STRING.

           MOVE FUNCTION REVERSE(WS-STRING) TO WS-REVERSE.
           DISPLAY WS-REVERSE.

           COMPUTE WS-LENGTH = FUNCTION LENGTH(WS-STRING).
           DISPLAY WS-LENGTH.
           STOP RUN.
